{
  "about": "WH1: the Hanging Ward's six house types (sim/ward/house.gd with the run flag ward_homes). Plan metres: x from the left outer wall's inner face to the right (the seed may mirror it), z from the front wall to the back. Rooms are rectangles [x0, z0, x1, z1] that tile each storey. A door joins two rooms on their shared edge; its centre is drawn from the seed in `at` (along that edge). Windows are where the Rigger's hand can come in: `wall` left, right, front or back, `at` the middle of the hole along that wall. A stair on storey s climbs from storey s-1 along `axis` x or z, at `lane`, from `from` (bottom) to `to` (top). Furniture `at` lists the places it may stand [x0, z0, x1, z1], one drawn from the seed; `h` its height; `hide` the kind of hiding place it makes.",
